                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]\r\nPuzzles of your dreams. Shortinger is a puzzle game mixed with platforming, but most of the time you gonna combine quarks together. Quarks are super tiny creatures that you collect. 3 give some sort of ability like hover up, kamehameha and others. Dialogs with characters are super long and I mean LOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOONG, can't skip them only press to speed up. When stuck, restart whole section. VIsuals are not the worst and kinda reminiscent of Rayman. Level design is mostly simple with focus on abilities usage. It's not the worst but in general boring to play. Music is ok. Resolution up to 1080p.\r\n[/h1]",
